<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.There were 12,400 head confirmed for week to date.</p>
<p>Confirmed -    None  Week Ago - None   Year Ago -  None</p>
<p>Wk to date - 12,400  Week Ago - None   Year Ago - 1,800</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
